      "CREB3L1 Loss Eliminates the ER-Stress Transducer OASIS in Osteoblasts",
      "Reduced Transcriptional Activation of COL1A1 and Type I Collagen Synthesis",
      "Collagen-Poor Bone Matrix, Low Bone Mass, and Skeletal Fragility"
